# Keep the image build context minimal. The build stage runs `make`, which only
# needs the Go module sources and the Makefile itself - it includes nothing the
# context would otherwise have to carry.
# vendor/ is included so the image build compiles from the committed dependency
# tree (go uses vendor/ automatically when present) instead of fetching modules
# from the network - the same tree every other build path uses.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!Makefile
!cmd
!internal
!vendor
